{"verse_key": "14:11", "surah": 14, "verse": 11, "text_uthmani": "قَالَتْ لَهُمْ رُسُلُهُمْ إِن نَّحْنُ إِلَّا بَشَرٌ مِّثْلُكُمْ وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَمُنُّ عَلَىٰ مَن يَشَآءُ مِنْ عِبَادِهِۦ ۖ وَمَا كَانَ لَنَآ أَن نَّأْتِيَكُم بِسُلْطَـٰنٍ إِلَّا بِإِذْنِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ وَعَلَى ٱللَّهِ فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "Their messengers said to them, \"We are only men like you, but Allāh confers favor upon whom He wills of His servants. It has never been for us to bring you evidence except by permission of Allāh. And upon Allāh let the believers rely.", "verse_from_ms": 292440, "verse_to_ms": 314770, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/14.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قَالَتْ", "start_ms": 292440, "end_ms": 293320}, {"i": 1, "text": "لَهُمْ", "start_ms": 293320, "end_ms": 295340}, {"i": 2, "text": "رُسُلُهُمْ", "start_ms": 295340, "end_ms": 297200}, {"i": 3, "text": "إِن", "start_ms": 297200, "end_ms": 298060}, {"i": 4, "text": "نَّحْنُ", "start_ms": 298060, "end_ms": 299620}, {"i": 5, "text": "إِلَّا", "start_ms": 299620, "end_ms": 300950}, {"i": 6, "text": "بَشَرٌ", "start_ms": 300950, "end_ms": 301960}, {"i": 7, "text": "مِّثْلُكُمْ", "start_ms": 301960, "end_ms": 304060}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَلَـٰكِنَّ", "start_ms": 304060, "end_ms": 305570}, {"i": 9, "text": "ٱللَّهَ", "start_ms": 305570, "end_ms": 305990}, {"i": 10, "text": "يَمُنُّ", "start_ms": 305990, "end_ms": 307660}, {"i": 11, "text": "عَلَىٰ", "start_ms": 307660, "end_ms": 308850}, {"i": 12, "text": "مَن", "start_ms": 308850, "end_ms": 309650}, {"i": 13, "text": "يَشَآءُ", "start_ms": 309650, "end_ms": 311270}, {"i": 14, "text": "مِنْ", "start_ms": 311270, "end_ms": 314655}, {"i": 15, "text": "عِبَادِهِۦ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 16, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 17, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 18, "text": "كَانَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 19, "text": "لَنَآ"